<title>USA: ANB Corp Q3 net increases.</title>
<headline>ANB Corp Q3 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>MUNCIE, Ind. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net			  1,562		    1,424</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,487		    4,554</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 1.03		   $ 0.90</p>
<p> Net			  4,634		    4,101</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,508		    4,559</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include FDIC Savings Association Insurance Fund charges of $0.03/shr in the Q3 and $0.08/shr for the nine months.</p>
<p>EPS amounts adjusted for two-for-one stock split distributed in December 1995.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
